// Level materials and UVs: a material dropped on a face, one put on the chosen face, the eyedropper
// (Alt+C) and Alt+V on the whole mesh, the material palette (Alt+1), U unwrapping a face, the UV
// editor (Alt+U): its UVs dragged across, then its Fit button.
